player_prompt.intro:
O Player {player_id} mo kgwelenyane ya batho ba 3 ya Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Kgwele ya kgwela e na le {num_rounds} diphofo.
Tsheelo ya phofolo:
• {conv_rounds} matšatši a go ja a kgwafatša
• 1 tsheko ya tšhošo - naya tšhošo e le nngwe ka motho yo mongwe: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' kapa '[<opp-id> defect]' (e, '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; e e kgonego ke 'go kgafatša'). 
Kgwele ya dipono tsa kgwelagana (e kgona kgwelana le kgwelagana e seng ya tsheko):
  - Ba kgafatša bobedi  ->  {reward}
  - Ba tšwa bobedi     ->  {punishment}
  - Wena o tšwa, ba kgafatša -> {temptation}
  - Wena o kgafatša, ba tšwa -> {sucker}
Motho(yo) a nang le tsore le le kgonego ka bogodu ya diphofo di sa felele o a kgona.
